{"custom_id": "421e851ffcfa680513ed6f685fa1340f38b702f9fd5cd085", "meta": {"loop": "topk4L01", "task": "generate_moderation_principle_3", "occurrence": 0, "attempt": 0, "max_tokens": 128000, "prompt_sha256": "40eb1a6efc9c6ab9f50294d832bd620a1c11fb39746d13ea443aaceee7a9d152", "prompt_chars": 4853}, "batch_id": "msgbatch_01C4yBAxD1zpP9YfPa3Ci73y", "saved_utc": "2026-10-22T12:08:50+00:00", "message": {"id": "msg_011CgHFLsmGerU721KLtG2KF", "container": null, "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"text": "- **Principle: Disease mentions in prepositional complements are not Modifiers.**\n  - **IF** a disease mention is the object of a prepositional complement (a noun phrase introduced by a preposition attached to a governing noun, such as a noun denoting history, risk, form, or the status of relatives or patients), **THEN** do not assign the Modifier label. Assign SpecificDisease if the mention names a particular disease entity, or DiseaseClass if it is a generic or unspecified category term with no named type.\n  - **Modifier scope:** Reserve the Modifier label for a disease term that is an attributive premodifier immediately preceding a non-disease head noun, such as a noun denoting a population, study, risk, case, patient group, gene, or protein.\n  - **Negative constraint:** This rule does **not** apply when the disease term is an attributive premodifier, because the Modifier label remains correct. It also does not apply when the prepositional phrase is internal to a single multi-token disease name, which takes its entity type as a unit, or when the disease mention is part of a coordinated structure governed by CompositeMention.\n  - **Generalization:** The rule applies to any disease noun in the complement position of any preposition, regardless of the governing noun or the particular disease, as long as the disease noun is not serving as an attributive premodifier.", "type": "text"}], "diagnostics": null, "model": "claude-haiku-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_details": null, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "stop_sequence": null, "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 1834, "output_tokens": 2995, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 2560}, "service_tier": "batch", "speed": "standard"}}}